   "source": [
    "features_df = pd.merge(prop_densities, spatial_dfs_all, left_index = True, right_index = True, how = 'outer')\n",
    "features_df = pd.merge(features_df, codetection_df, left_index = True, right_index = True, how = 'outer')\n",
    "features_df = pd.merge(features_df, metadata, left_index = True, right_on = 'batch', how = 'left')\n",
    "features_df.index = features_df['batch']\n",
    "\n",
    "features_df.head(5)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Now we make the GLMCollection class that stores all of the regression models, then we fit and do permutation tests"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "First we setup the comparison we want to make:\n",
    "\n",
    "We are interested in comparing diagnosis stage (no_sil, lsil, hsil, invasive) for squamous cell, p53-, HPV- patients"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 8,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# col:val pairs for preselection. All patients used in the comparison must match this criteria\n",
    "preselection = {\n",
    "    'SCC_ADENO': 'SCC',\n",
    "    'P53': 0,\n",
    "}\n",
    "\n",
    "# Key(s) for pseudobulking. We are pseudobulking per patient\n",
    "group_key = ['Accession_no']\n",
    "\n",
    "# Columns we are using for our predictors: we want to see differences in diagnosis stages\n",
    "comparisons = ['Diagnosis']"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 9,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# A quick filtering of our dataset to trim very low stats categories:\n",
    "sub_feature_df = features_df[features_df['Diagnosis'] != 'SIL_ungraded'].copy()\n",
    "\n",
    "# Make the glmcollection\n",
    "glms = GLMCollection(sub_feature_df, preselection, group_key, comparisons)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Add primary celltype/niche proportions and primary celltype spatial correlations to the model\n",
    "\n",
    "In general you want to fit features in batches"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 10,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stderr",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Creating Models from Batch:   0%|          | 0/300 [00:00<?, ?it/s]"
     ]
    },
    {
     "name": "stderr",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Creating Models from Batch: 100%|██████████| 300/300 [00:03<00:00, 80.98it/s]\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "# List of celltype comparisons to skip\n",
    "skip = defaultdict(list)\n",
    "skip['primary_celltype'] = ['NOS', 'muscle', 'neural'] # Skip primary celltypes with too limited statistics for comparisons\n",
    "skip['secondary_celltype'] = ['NOS', 'muscle', 'Mast_cell', 'neural'] # Skip when primary celltype only has 1 secondary celltype\n",
    "skip['tertiary_celltype'] = ['NOS', 'muscle', 'Mast_cell', 'neural', 'Epithelial', 'Epithelial_glandular', 'Epithelial_mixed', 'Epithelium_neuroendocrine', 'NK_gdT', 'pDC'] # Skip when secondary celltype only has 1 tertiary celltype\n",
    "\n",
    "#cols_to_add = [c for c in sub_feature_df.columns if 'primary_celltype_proportion_per_annot_region' in c or 'niche_cellcharter_proportion_per_annot_region' in c or 'primary_celltype_spatial_correlation' in c]\n",
    "cols_to_add = [c for c in sub_feature_df.columns if 'primary_celltype_proportion_per_annot_region' in c or 'primary_celltype_spatial_correlation' in c]\n",
    "\n",
    "glms.add_models_batch(cols_to_add, skip = skip, verbose = True)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Fit the models and the null models"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 11,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stderr",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Fitting full models: 100%|██████████| 300/300 [00:08<00:00, 36.56it/s] \n",
      "Fitting null models: 100%|██████████| 300/300 [00:00<00:00, 538.30it/s]\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "glms.fit_models_parallel(verbose = True)\n",
    "glms.fit_null_models_parallel(verbose = True)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 12,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
