   "source": [
    "# Now that we have the significant features, we have to do the pairwise testing\n",
    "\n",
    "* Previously we permuted all patients across all stages\n",
    "* For pairwise comparisons, we only want to look at patients within the two groups we're comparing\n",
    "\n",
    "There is probably a much better way to do this but here's what I currently do"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "First we have to define the contrasts for the pairwise comparisons"
